DATA DISCLAIMER:

This project uses simulated data for demonstration purposes. Player names and 
roster information are based on publicly available information. All daily 
monitoring data (wellness, training load, force plate testing) is algorithmically 
generated to demonstrate system capabilities and does not represent actual 
athlete data.

The system architecture, machine learning approaches, and analytical methods 
are based on peer-reviewed sport science research (2020-2025). Thresholds and 
recommendations follow published guidelines for load management in professional 
basketball.

This software is provided for educational and portfolio purposes. Any use in 
actual athlete monitoring should include proper validation with real data and 
